  "name": "Relgar's Hounds",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/magic/nature/wolf-paw-glow-large-orange.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Summons up to three fire hounds, each attacking a different target within range for 5d6 + {{spellPower}} damage. The mana cost is paid per hound.</p><p>Each hound makes the caster test Will + {{spellPower}} against its target's Strength or Dexterity.</p><p><strong>On success:</strong> the target is knocked Prone and takes a further 5d6 + {{spellPower}} damage, then the hound disappears.</p><p><strong>On failure:</strong> the target loses one Action.</p><p><strong>On failure by a margin of 50 or more:</strong> nothing happens, and the target's chance to catch Burning from this spell drops by 20%.</p>",
